    "type": "game",
    "name": "Delivery Point Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3672790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Point Simulator</strong> is a unique business simulator where you manage a network of delivery points in a challenging world of competition and informal schemes. In this game you will not only have to develop your delivery points, but also face such challenges as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gray market and smuggling:</strong> sell counterfeit goods, take risks on lotteries, but don't forget about responsibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competition and attacks:</strong> attack your competitors, or defend yourself against their attacks using your financial resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illegal transactions:</strong> take advantage of every opportunity to increase your profits, but keep in mind - every choice has consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your strategy, manage your resources, and decide how far you're willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a risk in auctions for collectibles and sell them, participate in raffles and improve your delivery points to take them to the next level.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Point Simulator</strong> is a unique business simulator where you manage a network of delivery points in a challenging world of competition and informal schemes. In this game you will not only have to develop your delivery points, but also face such challenges as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gray market and smuggling:</strong> sell counterfeit goods, take risks on lotteries, but don't forget about responsibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competition and attacks:</strong> attack your competitors, or defend yourself against their attacks using your financial resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illegal transactions:</strong> take advantage of every opportunity to increase your profits, but keep in mind - every choice has consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your strategy, manage your resources, and decide how far you're willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a risk in auctions for collectibles and sell them, participate in raffles and improve your delivery points to take them to the next level.</p>",
    "short_description": "Business simulator with strategy elements, where you manage a network of order delivery points in the conditions of severe competition, gray schemes and unexpected risks. Develop your business, improve points, defend against competitors' attacks, conduct risky transactions in the gray market.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Ukrainian, German, Spanish - Spain",
